# BUILD BUDS — COMPLETE HOMEPAGE DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT BRIEF

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, polished, responsive and visually distinctive homepage for **Build Buds**, a digital creator community created by the Smart Techies Group from JW Studios.

Build Buds is a network for young builders from different schools to share what they create, learn from one another, solve problems, collaborate on ideas and grow together through technology and creativity.

The platform brings together students who create games, build websites, experiment with digital tools, develop creative projects and enjoy learning by making things.

Build Buds is not simply a school website, a coding tutorial site or a static portfolio gallery. It is intended to become a connected community where creating, sharing, discussing, discovering and collaborating all happen in one place.

The long-term platform vision combines elements of a project showcase, a discussion community, a social network and a private messaging platform.

The homepage must communicate this vision immediately, make the platform feel exciting and welcoming, showcase what members can do, and encourage visitors to join the community.

**Your task is to DESIGN AND BUILD THE ACTUAL HOMEPAGE, not merely describe a design, return a wireframe, or produce a list of suggestions.**

Create a functional frontend implementation with realistic content, thoughtful interactions, a strong visual hierarchy, high-quality animations and a complete responsive experience.

Do not stop after producing the hero section. Build the entire homepage from the navigation through the footer.

