## 3. STRICT BRAND COLOUR SYSTEM

The supplied reference image establishes the official colour direction.

Use these exact brand colours:

- Lemon yellow: #FFF025
- Berry pink / magenta: #B11469
- Burnt orange: #C15D00
- White: #FFFFFF
- Black: #000000

